@startuml
left to right direction

actor Student
actor Administrator

rectangle "Smart Campus" {
  usecase "View room availability" as UC_View
  usecase "Book room" as UC_Book
  usecase "Cancel own booking" as UC_Cancel
  usecase "Block room" as UC_Block
  usecase "Unblock room" as UC_Unblock
  usecase "Review usage" as UC_Review
}

Student -- UC_View
Student -- UC_Book
Student -- UC_Cancel
Administrator -- UC_Block
Administrator -- UC_Unblock
Administrator -- UC_Review

note right of UC_Book
  R4: a successful booking produces a confirmation.
  Assumption: touching bookings are allowed.
end note

note right of UC_Block
  Assumption: blocking a room keeps existing bookings.
end note
@enduml
